    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Well-Presented Three-Bedroom Townhouse in a City Centre Location!\r\n\r\nThis recently renovated three-bedroom townhouse enjoys a central position in the heart of Waterford City, offering comfortable accommodation together with a surprisingly spacious rear garden. \r\n\r\nIdeally located within a short stroll of Tesco Poleberry, TK Maxx, the Odeon Cinema and a selection of excellent primary and secondary schools, the property is also just a five-minute walk from Waterford City Centre. With a host of shops, services, leisure facilities and amenities close by, this is a home that truly puts everything on your doorstep.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is laid out over three floors. The ground floor comprises an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. The first floor features a double bedroom and shower room, while the second floor provides two further bedrooms. There is also Stira access to the attic, providing useful additional storage.\r\n\r\nA particular highlight is the generously sized, low-maintenance rear garden. This is a rare and highly desirable feature for a city-centre property and provides an excellent space for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing.\r\n\r\nThe property further benefits from a B BER rating, double-glazed windows and zoned gas-fired central heating.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity for families,  or investors seeking a well-located home with generous accommodation and the added benefit of spacious outdoor space.\r\n\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended through the sole selling agents, Barry Murphy Auctioneers.\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nOpen plan kitchen/dining/living: 6.48m x 3.52m. Laminate floor, blinds, feature wall with electric fire and panelling, fitted kitchen with integrated oven, hob & fridge freezer.\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1: 3m x 3.75m. Laminate floor, blinds.\r\nShower Room: 3.35m x 1.3m. Fully tiled, WC, wash hand basin with vanity unit, shower, heated towel rail.\r\nSecond Floor\r\nBedroom 2: 2.79m x 3.74m. Laminate floor, blinds.\r\nBedroom 3: 3.59m x 1.38m. Laminate floor, blinds."
      },
      {
